OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent body to scrutinise    
OL,4,Apool's swim lessons                    
OL,6,FAn independent body is to scrutinise   
OL,7,Fswimming lessons at a leisure centre   
OL,8,Ffollowing a dispute.                   
OL,10,FPenrith Swimming Club, which has run   
OL,11,Flessons at Penrith Leisure Centre for  
OL,12,Fdecades, was told in August it does not
OL,13,Fhave a formal agreement to stage its   
OL,14,Fclasses at its teaching pool following 
OL,15,Fa dispute with its operator Greenwich  
OL,16,FLeisure Limited (GLL).                 
OL,18,FGLL previously said it valued "all our 
OL,19,Fpool users" and had discussed with the 
OL,20,Fclub "how we can retain their          
OL,21,Finvolvement for the benefit of         
OL,22,Fswimmers".                             
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
