OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent body to scrutinise    
OL,4,Apool's swim lessons                    
OL,6,FWestmorland and Furness Council said   
OL,7,Fthe club and GLL agreed to take part in
OL,8,Fan independent review led by Swim      
OL,9,FEngland, the national governing body   
OL,10,Ffor the sport.                         
